{"v":[{"a":["وَيۡلٞ","لِّلۡمُطَفِّفِينَ"],"t":"Woe to the defrauders","l":"Waylun Lilmutaffifina","w":[["waylun","Woe"],["lil'muṭaffifīna","to those who give less"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","إِذَا","ٱكۡتَالُواْ","عَلَى","ٱلنَّاسِ","يَسۡتَوۡفُونَ"],"t":"Those who, when they take a measure from people, they take in full","l":"Al-Ladhina 'Idha Aktalu `Ala An-Nasi Yastawfuna","w":[["alladhīna","Those who"],["idhā","when"],["ik'tālū","they take a measure"],["ʿalā","from"],["l-nāsi","the people"],["yastawfūna","they take in full"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","كَالُوهُمۡ","أَو","وَّزَنُوهُمۡ","يُخۡسِرُونَ"],"t":"But when they measure or weigh to others, they cheat","l":"Wa 'Idha Kaluhum 'Aw Wazanuhum Yukhsiruna","w":[["wa-idhā","But when"],["kālūhum","they give by measure (to) them"],["aw","or"],["wazanūhum","they weigh (for) them"],["yukh'sirūna","they give less"]]},{"a":["أَلَا","يَظُنُّ","أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","أَنَّهُم","مَّبۡعُوثُونَ"],"t":"Do these not know that they will be resurrected","l":"Ala Yazunnu 'Ula'ika 'Annahum Mab`uthuna","w":[["alā","Do not"],["yaẓunnu","think"],["ulāika","those"],["annahum","that they"],["mabʿūthūna","(will be) resurrected"]]},{"a":["لِيَوۡمٍ","عَظِيمٖ"],"t":"For a Great Day","l":"Liyawmin `Azimin","w":[["liyawmin","For a Day"],["ʿaẓīmin","Great"]]},{"a":["يَوۡمَ","يَقُومُ","ٱلنَّاسُ","لِرَبِّ","ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ"],"t":"The Day when mankind will stand before the Lord of the Worlds","l":"Yawma Yaqumu An-Nasu Lirabbi Al-`Alamina","w":[["yawma","(The) Day"],["yaqūmu","will stand"],["l-nāsu","mankind"],["lirabbi","before (the) Lord"],["l-ʿālamīna","(of) the worlds"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّ","كِتَٰبَ","ٱلۡفُجَّارِ","لَفِي","سِجِّينٖ"],"t":"Not at all. The record of the wicked is in Sijjeen","l":"Kalla 'Inna Kitaba Al-Fujjari Lafi Sijjinin","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["inna","Indeed"],["kitāba","(the) record"],["l-fujāri","(of) the wicked"],["lafī","(is) surely in"],["sijjīnin","Sijjin"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","سِجِّينٞ"],"t":"But how can you know what Sijjeen is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma Sijjinun","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","can make you know"],["mā","what"],["sijjīnun","(is) Sijjin"]]},{"a":["كِتَٰبٞ","مَّرۡقُومٞ"],"t":"A numerical book","l":"Kitabun Marqumun","w":[["kitābun","A book"],["marqūmun","written"]]},{"a":["وَيۡلٞ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","لِّلۡمُكَذِّبِينَ"],"t":"Woe on that Day to the deniers","l":"Waylun Yawma'idhin Lilmukadhibina","w":[["waylun","Woe"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["lil'mukadhibīna","to the deniers"]]},{"a":["ٱلَّذِينَ","يُكَذِّبُونَ","بِيَوۡمِ","ٱلدِّينِ"],"t":"Those who deny the Day of Reckoning","l":"Al-Ladhina Yukadhibuna Biyawmi Ad-Dini","w":[["alladhīna","Those who"],["yukadhibūna","deny"],["biyawmi","(the) Day"],["l-dīni","(of) the Judgment"]]},{"a":["وَمَا","يُكَذِّبُ","بِهِۦٓ","إِلَّا","كُلُّ","مُعۡتَدٍ","أَثِيمٍ"],"t":"But none denies it except the sinful aggressor","l":"Wa Ma Yukadhibu Bihi 'Illa Kullu Mu`tadin 'Athimin","w":[["wamā","And not"],["yukadhibu","can deny"],["bihi","[of] it"],["illā","except"],["kullu","every"],["muʿ'tadin","transgressor"],["athīmin","sinful"]]},{"a":["إِذَا","تُتۡلَىٰ","عَلَيۡهِ","ءَايَٰتُنَا","قَالَ","أَسَٰطِيرُ","ٱلۡأَوَّلِينَ"],"t":"When Our revelations are recited to him, he says, “Legends of the ancients.”","l":"Idha Tutla `Alayhi 'Ayatuna Qala 'Asatiru Al-'Awwalina","w":[["idhā","When"],["tut'lā","are recited"],["ʿalayhi","to him"],["āyātunā","Our Verses"],["qāla","he says"],["asāṭīru","Stories"],["l-awalīna","(of) the former (people)"]]},{"a":["كَلَّاۖ","بَلۡۜ","رَانَ","عَلَىٰ","قُلُوبِهِم","مَّا","كَانُواْ","يَكۡسِبُونَ"],"t":"Not at all. Their hearts have become corroded by what they used to earn","l":"Kalla Bal Rana `Ala Qulubihim Ma Kanu Yaksibuna","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["bal","But"],["rāna","(the) stain has covered"],["ʿalā","[over]"],["qulūbihim","their hearts"],["mā","(for) what"],["kānū","they used to"],["yaksibūna","earn"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّهُمۡ","عَن","رَّبِّهِمۡ","يَوۡمَئِذٖ","لَّمَحۡجُوبُونَ"],"t":"Not at all. On that Day, they will be screened from their Lord","l":"Kalla 'Innahum `An Rabbihim Yawma'idhin Lamahjubuna","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["innahum","Indeed, they"],["ʿan","from"],["rabbihim","their Lord"],["yawma-idhin","that Day"],["lamaḥjūbūna","surely will be partitioned"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","إِنَّهُمۡ","لَصَالُواْ","ٱلۡجَحِيمِ"],"t":"Then they will roast in Hell","l":"Thumma 'Innahum Lasalu Al-Jahimi","w":[["thumma","Then"],["innahum","indeed, they"],["laṣālū","(surely) will burn"],["l-jaḥīmi","(in) the Hellfire"]]},{"a":["ثُمَّ","يُقَالُ","هَٰذَا","ٱلَّذِي","كُنتُم","بِهِۦ","تُكَذِّبُونَ"],"t":"Then it will be said, “This is what you used to deny.”","l":"Thumma Yuqalu Hadha Al-Ladhi Kuntum Bihi Tukadhibuna","w":[["thumma","Then"],["yuqālu","it will be said"],["hādhā","This"],["alladhī","(is) what"],["kuntum","you used to"],["bihi","[of it]"],["tukadhibūna","deny"]]},{"a":["كَلَّآ","إِنَّ","كِتَٰبَ","ٱلۡأَبۡرَارِ","لَفِي","عِلِّيِّينَ"],"t":"No indeed; the record of the righteous is in Elliyyeen","l":"Kalla 'Inna Kitaba Al-'Abrari Lafi `Illiyina","w":[["kallā","Nay"],["inna","Indeed"],["kitāba","(the) record"],["l-abrāri","(of) the righteous"],["lafī","(will be) surely in"],["ʿilliyyīna","Illiyin"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أَدۡرَىٰكَ","مَا","عِلِّيُّونَ"],"t":"But how can you know what Elliyyoon is","l":"Wa Ma 'Adraka Ma `Illiyuna","w":[["wamā","And what"],["adrāka","can make you know"],["mā","what"],["ʿilliyyūna","(is) Illiyun"]]},{"a":["كِتَٰبٞ","مَّرۡقُومٞ"],"t":"A numerical book","l":"Kitabun Marqumun","w":[["kitābun","A book"],["marqūmun","written"]]},{"a":["يَشۡهَدُهُ","ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ"],"t":"Witnessed by those brought near","l":"Yash/haduhu Al-Muqarrabuna","w":[["yashhaduhu","Witness it"],["l-muqarabūna","those brought near"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلۡأَبۡرَارَ","لَفِي","نَعِيمٍ"],"t":"Indeed, the righteous will be amid bliss","l":"Inna Al-'Abrara Lafi Na`imin","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["l-abrāra","the righteous"],["lafī","(will be) surely in"],["naʿīmin","bliss"]]},{"a":["عَلَى","ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"t":"On thrones, looking on","l":"Ala Al-'Ara'iki Yanzuruna","w":[["ʿalā","On"],["l-arāiki","thrones"],["yanẓurūna","observing"]]},{"a":["تَعۡرِفُ","فِي","وُجُوهِهِمۡ","نَضۡرَةَ","ٱلنَّعِيمِ"],"t":"You will recognize on their faces the radiance of bliss","l":"Ta`rifu Fi Wujuhihim Nađrata An-Na`imi","w":[["taʿrifu","You will recognize"],["fī","in"],["wujūhihim","their faces"],["naḍrata","(the) radiance"],["l-naʿīmi","(of) bliss"]]},{"a":["يُسۡقَوۡنَ","مِن","رَّحِيقٖ","مَّخۡتُومٍ"],"t":"They will be given to drink a sealed wine","l":"Yusqawna Min Rahiqin Makhtumin","w":[["yus'qawna","They will be given to drink"],["min","of"],["raḥīqin","a pure wine"],["makhtūmin","sealed"]]},{"a":["خِتَٰمُهُۥ","مِسۡكٞۚ","وَفِي","ذَٰلِكَ","فَلۡيَتَنَافَسِ","ٱلۡمُتَنَٰفِسُونَ"],"t":"Whose seal is musk—this is what competitors should compete for","l":"Khitamuhu Miskun Wa Fi Dhalika Falyatanafasi Al-Mutanafisuna","w":[["khitāmuhu","Its seal"],["mis'kun","(will be of) musk"],["wafī","And for"],["dhālika","that"],["falyatanāfasi","let aspire"],["l-mutanāfisūna","the aspirers"]]},{"a":["وَمِزَاجُهُۥ","مِن","تَسۡنِيمٍ"],"t":"Its mixture is of Tasneem","l":"Wa Mizajuhu Min Tasnimin","w":[["wamizājuhu","And its mixture"],["min","(is) of"],["tasnīmin","Tasneem"]]},{"a":["عَيۡنٗا","يَشۡرَبُ","بِهَا","ٱلۡمُقَرَّبُونَ"],"t":"A spring from which those brought near drink","l":"Aynaan Yashrabu Biha Al-Muqarrabuna","w":[["ʿaynan","A spring"],["yashrabu","will drink"],["bihā","from it"],["l-muqarabūna","those brought near"]]},{"a":["إِنَّ","ٱلَّذِينَ","أَجۡرَمُواْ","كَانُواْ","مِنَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُواْ","يَضۡحَكُونَ"],"t":"Those who committed crimes used to laugh at those who believed","l":"Inna Al-Ladhina 'Ajramu Kanu Mina Al-Ladhina 'Amanu Yađhakuna","w":[["inna","Indeed"],["alladhīna","those who"],["ajramū","committed crimes"],["kānū","used to"],["mina","at"],["alladhīna","those who"],["āmanū","believed"],["yaḍḥakūna","laugh"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","مَرُّواْ","بِهِمۡ","يَتَغَامَزُونَ"],"t":"And when they passed by them, they would wink at one another","l":"Wa 'Idha Marru Bihim Yataghamazuna","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["marrū","they passed"],["bihim","by them"],["yataghāmazūna","they winked at one another"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","ٱنقَلَبُوٓاْ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَهۡلِهِمُ","ٱنقَلَبُواْ","فَكِهِينَ"],"t":"And when they went back to their families, they would go back exulting","l":"Wa 'Idha Anqalabu 'Ila 'Ahlihimu Anqalabu Fakihina","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["inqalabū","they returned"],["ilā","to"],["ahlihimu","their people"],["inqalabū","they would return"],["fakihīna","jesting"]]},{"a":["وَإِذَا","رَأَوۡهُمۡ","قَالُوٓاْ","إِنَّ","هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","لَضَآلُّونَ"],"t":"And if they saw them, they would say, “These people are lost.”","l":"Wa 'Idha Ra'awhum Qalu 'Inna Ha'uula' Lađalluna","w":[["wa-idhā","And when"],["ra-awhum","they saw them"],["qālū","they said"],["inna","Indeed"],["hāulāi","these"],["laḍāllūna","surely have gone astray"]]},{"a":["وَمَآ","أُرۡسِلُواْ","عَلَيۡهِمۡ","حَٰفِظِينَ"],"t":"Yet they were not sent as guardians over them","l":"Wa Ma 'Ursilu `Alayhim Hafizina","w":[["wamā","But not"],["ur'silū","they had been sent"],["ʿalayhim","over them"],["ḥāfiẓīna","(as) guardians"]]},{"a":["فَٱلۡيَوۡمَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ءَامَنُواْ","مِنَ","ٱلۡكُفَّارِ","يَضۡحَكُونَ"],"t":"But on that Day, those who believed will laugh at the unbelievers","l":"Falyawma Al-Ladhina 'Amanu Mina Al-Kuffari Yađhakuna","w":[["fal-yawma","So today"],["alladhīna","those who"],["āmanū","believed "],["mina","at"],["l-kufāri","the disbelievers"],["yaḍḥakūna","they will laugh"]]},{"a":["عَلَى","ٱلۡأَرَآئِكِ","يَنظُرُونَ"],"t":"On luxurious furnishings, looking on","l":"Ala Al-'Ara'iki Yanzuruna","w":[["ʿalā","On"],["l-arāiki","the thrones"],["yanẓurūna","observing"]]},{"a":["هَلۡ","ثُوِّبَ","ٱلۡكُفَّارُ","مَا","كَانُواْ","يَفۡعَلُونَ"],"t":"Have the unbelievers been repaid for what they used to do","l":"Hal Thuwiba Al-Kuffaru Ma Kanu Yaf`aluna","w":[["hal","Have (not)"],["thuwwiba","been rewarded"],["l-kufāru","the disbelievers"],["mā","(for) what"],["kānū","they used to"],["yafʿalūna","do"]]}]}